                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-slate-300">Controls $100,000</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-green-400">+$1,000</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-red-400">-$1,000</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 font-medium text-white">1:200</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-slate-300">Controls $200,000</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-green-400">+$2,000</td>
                  <td class="py-3 px-4 text-red-400">-$2,000</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
          
          <div class="p-4 bg-amber-900/20 rounded-lg border border-amber-800/30">
            <p class="text-sm text-amber-200">
              <span class="font-semibold">Margin Calls:</span> If your account equity falls below required margin levels, you may receive a margin call and be required to deposit additional funds immediately. Failure to meet margin calls may result in automatic position liquidation.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Liquidity Risk -->
      <section id="liquidity" class="risk-card p-6 fade-in">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-600/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
            <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-blue-400">💧</span>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">Liquidity Risk</h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">Ability to enter/exit positions</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="p-4 bg-slate-800/20 rounded-lg">
            <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm">
